-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Cuando no estamos combatiendo, cazamos para conseguir carne. La carne nos hace fuertes. Y un estómago satisfecho combate mejor que uno vacío.$B$BLo mismo ocurre con los Magram. Almacenan carne para poder combatir más tiempo seguido sin tener que ir a cazar. Si asaltas su poblado del este y les robas su reserva de carne, les fallarán las fuerzas.", Details AC enUS : "When we are not at war, we hunt for meat.  Meat gives us strength, and full bellies fight harder than empty ones.$B$BIt is the same with the Magram.  They store extra meat so they may fight longer between hunts.  If you raid their village to the east and take their stores of meat, then their strength will fail." ; Wowhead enUS : "When we are not at war, we hunt for meat. Meat gives us strength, and full bellies fight harder than empty ones.$b$bIt is the same with the Magram. They store extra meat so they may fight longer between hunts. If you raid their village to the east and take their stores of meat, then their strength will fail.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Gelkis Clan Centaur"
