-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Vine a Cuna del Invierno para investigar los Baños Escarchados. He observado que el agua parece tener... cualidades extrañas. Todavía no he podido descubrir la fuente y, para serte sincera, últimamente he tenido algunos problemas a causa de los fúrbolgs Nevada.$B$BParecen sentirse atraídos por las fuentes, igual que yo. Se han vuelto extremadamente protectores con el agua, no permiten que me acerque a los dos manantiales más grandes, al norte de aquí.$B$BMe gustaría seguir con mis estudios, ¿me ayudarás?", Details AC enUS : "I came to Winterspring to investigate the Frostfire Hot Springs. I've noticed that the water seems to have ...strange qualities. I haven't yet been able to discover the source, and to tell you the truth, I've had some difficulty lately, due to the Winterfall furbolg.$B$BThey seem to be drawn to the springs, just as I am. They have become extremely protective of the water, and won't let me come near the two larger springs to the north of here.$B$BI'd like to continue my studies, so won't you help me?" ; Wowhead enUS : "I came to Winterspring to investigate the Frostfire Hot Springs. I've noticed that the water seems to have ...strange qualities. I haven't yet been able to discover the source, and to tell you the truth, I've had some difficulty lately, due to the Winterfall furbolg.$b$bThey seem to be drawn to the springs, just as I am. They have become extremely protective of the water, and won't let me come near the two larger springs to the north of here.$b$bI'd like to continue my studies, so won't you help me?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Vine a Cuna del Invierno para investigar los Baños Escarchados. He observado que el agua parece tener... cualidades extrañas. Todavía no he podido descubrir la fuente y, para serte sincera, últimamente he tenido algunos problemas a causa de los fúrbolgs Nevada.$b$bParecen sentirse atraídos por las fuentes, igual que yo. Se han vuelto extremadamente protectores con el agua, no permiten que me acerque a los dos manantiales más grandes, al norte de aquí.$b$bMe gustaría seguir con mis estudios, ¿me ayudarás?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esMX' AND `ID` = 5082;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "El vial que recogiste de los fúrbolgs Nevada está vacío, pero detectas unas gotas de un extraño líquido verdoso en su interior. Casi brilla.$B$B¿Puede ser importante?$B$BSeguramente Donova Cubilnevado podrá decirte algo más ya que lleva un tiempo acampada junto a las fuentes termales de Cuna del Invierno.", Details AC enUS : "This vial that you picked up from the Winterfall furbolg is empty, but you can detect a few drops of a strange green liquid inside; it almost glows.$B$BIs it something important?$B$BDonova Snowden would probably be able to tell you more, since she has been camped by the hot springs in Winterspring for some time now." ; Wowhead enUS : "This vial that you picked up from the Winterfall furbolg is empty, but you can detect a few drops of a strange green liquid inside; it almost glows.$b$bIs it something important?$b$bDonova Snowden would probably be able to tell you more, since she has been camped by the hot springs in Winterspring for some time now."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'El vial que recogiste de los fúrbolgs Nevada está vacío, pero detectas unas gotas de un extraño líquido verdoso en su interior. Casi brilla.$b$b¿Puede ser importante?$b$bSeguramente Donova Cubilnevado podrá decirte algo más ya que lleva un tiempo acampada junto a las fuentes termales de Cuna del Invierno.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esMX' AND `ID` = 5083;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "En el cadáver del reptil derrotado descubres lo que parece ser una nota de cierta importancia: una carta de su superior, el general Drakkisath, sobre protocolo.$B$BTu instinto te dice que deberías llevársela al mariscal Maxwell.", Details AC enUS : "From the corpse of the defeated serpent you uncover what appears to be a note of some importance: A letter from his superior, General Drakkisath, concerning protocol.$B$BYour instinct tells you that you should take it to Marshal Maxwell." ; Wowhead enUS : "From the corpse of the defeated serpent you uncover what appears to be a note of some importance: A letter from his superior, General Drakkisath, concerning protocol.$b$bYour instinct tells you that you should take it to Marshal Maxwell."
