-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Los Renegados no son contagiosos, por así decir. Al parecer, este enviado promete la no-muerte a quien se una a él. Creo que pertenece a la Plaga.$B$BAunque ahora no me preocupa él, sino la gente arracimada a su alrededor. Salen día a día de las sombras, suplicándole más poder.$B$BNo puedo luchar contra ellos sin ayuda, $n. ¿Qué me dices? ¿Te apetece cazar?", Details AC enUS : "The Forsaken do not pass on their... illness... from what I have seen. This diplomat seems to be granting undeath to would-be followers. I am beginning to think he is one of the Scourge.$B$BFor now, my concern is not with him though, it's with the growing ranks around him. They creep from the shadows daily, almost begging him for more power.$B$BI'm not powerful enough to fight them on my own, $N. What do you say? Are you up for some hunting?" ; Wowhead enUS : "The Forsaken do not pass on their... illness... from what I have seen. This diplomat seems to be granting undeath to would-be followers. I am beginning to think he is one of the Scourge.$b$bFor now, my concern is not with him though, it's with the growing ranks around him. They creep from the shadows daily, almost begging him for more power.$b$bI'm not powerful enough to fight them on my own, $n. What do you say? Are you up for some hunting?",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Razorfen Battleguard slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Razorfen Thornweaver slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Death's Head Cultist slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Los Renegados no son contagiosos, por así decir. Al parecer, este enviado promete la no-muerte a quien se una a él. Creo que pertenece a la Plaga.$b$bAunque ahora no me preocupa él, sino la gente arracimada a su alrededor. Salen día a día de las sombras, suplicándole más poder.$b$bNo puedo luchar contra ellos sin ayuda, $n. ¿Qué me dices? ¿Te apetece cazar?', `Objectivetext1` = 'Guardia de batalla de Rajacieno matado', `Objectivetext2` = 'Tejespina de Rajacieno matado', `Objectivetext3` = 'Cultor Caramuerte matado', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esMX' AND `ID` = 6626;
-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "Mantén a salvo a Muglash en su viaje hacia el blandón. Ayúdalo a apagar el blandón y entonces protégelo frente a los nagas.$B$BSi sales $gairoso:airosa;, vuelve a la Avanzada de Zoram'gar e informa al corredor Grito de Guerra sobre la muerte de Vorsha la Azotadora.", Objectives AC enUS : "Keep Muglash safe as he travels to the brazier. Help him by putting the brazier out, then protect him as you fight against the Naga.$B$BIf you are successful, return to the Zoram'gar Outpost and inform the Warsong Runner of the death of Vorsha the Lasher." ; Wowhead enUS : "Keep Muglash safe as he travels to the brazier. Help him by putting the brazier out, then protect him as you fight against the Naga.$b$bIf you are successful, return to the Zoram'gar Outpost and inform the Warsong Runner of the death of Vorsha the Lasher.",  OLD Details : "Vorsha la Azotadora... la monstruosa hidra que recorre los mares...$B$BHa atacado nuestra avanzada, sin que nadie la provoque, arrasando allá por donde pasa.$B$BPero estoy listo, $n. Me he preparado para vencer a la hidra y poner fin a estos ataques sobre Zoram'gar.$B$BLos nagas honran la malvada naturaleza de este monstruo con un blandón que permanece encendido en una isla a escasa distancia de la costa. Creo que si lo apagamos, provocaremos la ira de Vorsha y aparecerá.$B$BNecesitaremos ayuda, así que asegúrate de traer aliados fuertes contigo.", Details AC enUS : "Vorsha the Lasher... the fiendish hydra that roams the seas...$B$BShe has attacked our outpost, each time unprovoked, laying waste to anything that falls in her path.$B$BBut I am ready, $N. I have prepared to best the hydra and end these attacks on Zoram'gar.$B$BThe naga honor the wicked nature of this beast with a brazier that remains lit on an island just off the coast. I believe that if we put it out, Vorsha will appear in anger.$B$BWe will need help, so be sure to bring some strong allies." ; Wowhead enUS : "Vorsha the Lasher... the fiendish hydra that roams the seas...$b$bShe has attacked our outpost, each time unprovoked, laying waste to anything that falls in her path.$b$bBut I am ready, $n. I have prepared to best the hydra and end these attacks on Zoram'gar.$b$bThe naga honor the wicked nature of this beast with a brazier that remains lit on an island just off the coast. I believe that if we put it out, Vorsha will appear in anger.$b$bWe will need help, so be sure to bring some strong allies."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = 'Mantén a Muglash a salvo mientras viaja hacia el blandón. Apaga el blandón para ayudarlo y luego lucha contra los nagas para protegerlo.$b$bSi tienes éxito, regresa a Avanzada de Zoram''gar e informa al corredor Grito de Guerra sobre la muerte de Vorsha la Azotadora.', `Details` = 'Vorsha la Azotadora... la monstruosa hidra que recorre los mares...$b$bHa atacado nuestra avanzada, sin que nadie la provoque, arrasando allá por donde pasa.$b$bPero estoy listo, $n. Me he preparado para vencer a la hidra y poner fin a estos ataques sobre Zoram''gar.$b$bLos nagas honran la malvada naturaleza de este monstruo con un blandón que permanece encendido en una isla a escasa distancia de la costa. Creo que si lo apagamos, provocaremos la ira de Vorsha y aparecerá.$b$bNecesitaremos ayuda, así que asegúrate de traer aliados fuertes contigo.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esMX' AND `ID` = 6641;
