-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "Captura a 5 ratas del subterráneo usando la flauta cazarratas. Guía a las ratas hasta Monty.", Objectives AC enUS : "Capture 5 Deeprun Rats by using the Rat Catcher's Flute. Lead the rats back to Monty. Don't forget to turn in the flute when you're finished." ; Wowhead enUS : "Capture 5 Deeprun Rats by using the Rat Catcher's Flute. Lead the rats back to Monty. Don't forget to turn in the flute when you're finished.",  OLD Details : "Alto ahí, pillastre. Eeeh... ¿Eeestás buscando curro? Nos tenemos un problemón de ratas aquí abajo y nos faltan manos en la cubierta de popa.$B$B¿Qué respondes? Solo tienes que coger esta flauta atrapa-ratas y tocar la canción alrededor de esas alimañas. ¡Te seguirán al fin del mundo!$B$BCaptúranos cinco de esos bichos y tráenoslos acá. Nos los queremos vivos.$B$BEeeh...", Details AC enUS : "Avast ye scallywag. Arrrr... Arrrr ye looking fer work? We gots a serious rat problem down here an' not enough hands on the poop deck.$B$BWhat do ye say? All ye needs to do is take this here rat catchin' flute and play the melody around the vermin. They'll follow ye to the ends of the world!$B$BJust capture five of the little buggers and bring em back here. We needs em alive.$B$BArrrrr..." ; Wowhead enUS : "Avast ye scallywag. Arrrr... Arrrr ye looking fer work? We gots a serious rat problem down here an' not enough hands on the poop deck.$b$bWhat do ye say? All ye needs to do is take this here rat catchin' flute and play the melody around the vermin. They'll follow ye to the ends of the world!$b$bJust capture five of the little buggers and bring em back here. We needs em alive.$b$bArrrrr..."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Objectives` = 'Utiliza la flauta cazarratas para capturar 5 ratas del subterráneo. Guía a las ratas hasta Monty. No olvides devolver la flauta cuando termines.', `Details` = 'Alto ahí, sabandija. Arrrr... ¿Eeestás buscando trabajo? Tenemos un problema de ratas aquí abajo y nos faltan manos en la cubierta de popa.$b$b¿Qué dices? Solo tienes que usar esta flauta atrapa-ratas y tocar la canción alrededor de esas alimañas. ¡Te seguirán al fin del mundo!$b$bCaptura cinco y tráelas acá. Las queremos vivas.$b$bArrrr...', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esMX' AND `ID` = 6661;
