-- AC datas : OLD Details : "La magia qiraji es poderosa y antigua. Los más poderosos qiraji empuñan objetos de tal potencia que harían vacilar hasta a un dragón.$B$BTráeme las ataduras de dominancia qiraji y otros componentes menores y crearé un par de poderosas botas para ti.$B$BTe servirán cuando te enfrentes al enemigo.", Details AC enUS : "Qiraji magic is strong and ancient.  The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon.$B$BBring me the qiraji bindings of dominance and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you.$B$BYou will find them useful in the fight against the enemy." ; Wowhead enUS : "Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon.$b$bBring me the qiraji bindings of dominance and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you.$b$bYou will find them useful in the fight against the enemy."
