-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Vaya, ¡cómo me alegra oír que nos ayudarás en el ataque a Ahn'Qiraj, $n! Puedo prepararte una protección que te ayudará en el combate contra el enemigo, $c.$B$BNecesitaré un manto qiraji, al que le daré tus medidas, claro. También necesitaré ídolos y escarabajos para confeccionarte un pasador apropiado.$B$BTe lo prometo, no te decepcionaré.", Details AC enUS : "I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $N.  I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$B$BI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course.  I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$B$BI promise you won't be disappointed." ; Wowhead enUS : "I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj, $n. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy, $c.$b$bI shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course. I'll also need idols and scarabs which I'll use to create a suitable clasp.$b$bI promise you won't be disappointed.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Cenarion Circle"
