-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$n,$B$BEn el pasado has servido a los intereses de El Alba Argenta de modo muy satisfactorio. Una vez más lanzamos una llamada de auxilio.$B$B$n, si deseas ayudarnos una vez más, preséntate al Guardián de los Pergaminos de la Capilla de la Esperanza de la Luz, en las Tierras de la Peste del Este.", Details AC enUS : "$N,$B$BIn times past you have served the interests of the Argent Dawn, always to the best of your abilities. Now, once again, we sound the clarion call in our time of greatest need.$B$B$N, please report to the Keeper of the Rolls at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands if you are willing to aid us once more." ; Wowhead enUS : "$n,$b$bIn times past you have served the interests of the Argent Dawn, always to the best of your abilities. Now, once again, we sound the clarion call in our time of greatest need.$b$b$n, please report to the Keeper of the Rolls at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands if you are willing to aid us once more."
