-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Has destruido dos de las mayores amenazas de Nagrand, $n. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para encargarte de la Plaga de los Campos de Espíritus?$B$BDurn el Hambriento gobierna la zona que rodea Oshu'gun, exterminándolo todo a su paso. Hasta ahora, nadie ha sido capaz de liberar Nagrand de esta feroz criatura. Adéntrate en los Campos de Espíritus, al suroeste de aquí, cerca de Oshu'gun. Busca a Durn. Mátalo y te aseguro que la recompensa será directamente proporcional a la dificultad de la tarea.|n", Details AC enUS : "You have destroyed two of the biggest threats in Nagrand, $N. Are you ready to take on the scourge of the Spirit Fields?$B$BDurn the Hungerer lords over the area surrounding Oshu'gun, decimating all in his path. Thus far, none have been able to rid Nagrand of this ferocious gronn. Gather your allies and venture to the Spirit Fields, far southwest of here, near Oshu'gun, and track down Durn. Slay him and I assure you rewards commensurate with the difficulty of the task at hand.$B" ; Wowhead enUS : "You have destroyed two of the biggest threats in Nagrand, $n. Are you ready to take on the scourge of the Spirit Fields?$b$bDurn the Hungerer lords over the area surrounding Oshu'gun, decimating all in his path. Thus far, none have been able to rid Nagrand of this ferocious gronn. Gather your allies and venture to the Spirit Fields, far southwest of here, near Oshu'gun, and track down Durn. Slay him and I assure you rewards commensurate with the difficulty of the task at hand.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Durn the Hungerer slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Has destruido dos de las mayores amenazas de Nagrand, $n. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada para encargarte de la Plaga de los Campos de Espíritus?$b$bDurn el Hambriento gobierna la zona que rodea Oshu''gun, exterminándolo todo a su paso. Hasta ahora, nadie ha sido capaz de liberar Nagrand de esta feroz criatura. Reúne a tus aliados y dirigíos a los Campos de Espíritus, al suroeste de aquí, cerca de Oshu''gun. Buscad a Durn. Matadle y te aseguro que la recompensa será directamente proporcional a la dificultad de la tarea.', `Objectivetext1` = 'Durn el Hambriento matado', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esMX' AND `ID` = 9937;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Has destruido dos de las mayores amenazas de Nagrand, $n. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada; para encargarte de la Plaga de los Campos de Espíritus?$B$BDurn el Hambriento gobierna la zona que rodea Oshu'gun, exterminándolo todo a su paso. Hasta ahora, nadie ha sido capaz de liberar Nagrand de esta feroz criatura. Adéntrate en los Campos de Espíritus, al oeste de aquí, y busca a Durn. Mátalo y te aseguro que la recompensa será directamente proporcional a la dificultad de la tarea.", Details AC enUS : "You have destroyed two of the biggest threats in Nagrand, $N. Are you ready to take on the scourge of the Spirit Fields?$B$BDurn the Hungerer lords over the area surrounding Oshu'gun, decimating all in his path. Thus far, none have been able to rid Nagrand of this ferocious gronn. Gather your allies and venture to the Spirit Fields, west of here, and track down Durn. Slay him and I assure you rewards commensurate with the difficulty of the task at hand." ; Wowhead enUS : "You have destroyed two of the biggest threats in Nagrand, $n. Are you ready to take on the scourge of the Spirit Fields?$b$bDurn the Hungerer lords over the area surrounding Oshu'gun, decimating all in his path. Thus far, none have been able to rid Nagrand of this ferocious gronn. Gather your allies and venture to the Spirit Fields, west of here, and track down Durn. Slay him and I assure you rewards commensurate with the difficulty of the task at hand.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Durn the Hungerer slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Has destruido dos de las mayores amenazas de Nagrand, $n. ¿Estás $gpreparado:preparada para encargarte de la Plaga de los Campos de Espíritus?$b$bDurn el Hambriento gobierna la zona que rodea Oshu''gun, exterminándolo todo a su paso. Hasta ahora, nadie ha sido capaz de liberar Nagrand de esta feroz criatura. Reúne a tus aliados y dirigíos a los Campos de Espíritus, al oeste de aquí, y buscad a Durn. Matadle y te aseguro que la recompensa será directamente proporcional a la dificultad de la tarea.', `Objectivetext1` = 'Durn el Hambriento matado', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esMX' AND `ID` = 9938;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Se busca: Vivo o muerto.$B$BZorbo el Consejero, por planear numerosos ataques contra Garadar. Junto con sus atracadores y chamanes, Zorbo ha matado incontables orcos. Se considera que Zorbo está armado, es peligroso y despiadado.$B$BSu hogar está en las Ruinas Riecráneos, en las montañas septentrionales de Nagrand.$B$BLa recompensa por la muerte o la captura de Zorbo el Consejero será entregada por el celador Tororroc en Garadar.", Details AC enUS : "Wanted: Dead or Alive$B$BZorbo the Advisor, wanted for numerous planned attacks on Garadar. Along with his reavers and shaman, Zorbo has slain countless orcs. Consider Zorbo as armed, dangerous, and merciless.$B$BZorbo makes his home in the Laughing Skull Ruins in the northern mountains of Nagrand.$B$BReward for Zorbo the Advisor's death or capture to be dispensed by Warden Bullrok at Garadar. " ; Wowhead enUS : "Wanted: Dead or Alive$b$bZorbo the Advisor, wanted for numerous planned attacks on Garadar. Along with his reavers and shaman, Zorbo has slain countless orcs. Consider Zorbo as armed, dangerous, and merciless.$b$bZorbo makes his home in the Laughing Skull Ruins in the northern mountains of Nagrand.$b$bReward for Zorbo the Advisor's death or capture to be dispensed by Warden Bullrok at Garadar.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Zorbo the Advisor slain",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Warmaul Shaman slain",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Warmaul Reaver slain"
