-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Mi propio padre fue asesinado por el líder de esa banda, Gamel el Cruel. Ha establecido su morada dentro de una cueva en la playa.$B$BYa te has encargado de sus hombres. Acaba lo que empezaste, $n. Venga a mi padre y compartiré lo poco que me queda contigo.", Details AC enUS : "My own father was slain by the leader of this raiding party, Gamel the Cruel.  He has made his abode inside a cave on the beach.$B$BYou've dealt with his men already.  Finish what you've started, $N.  Avenge my father and I will share with you what little I still have." ; Wowhead enUS : "My own father was slain by the leader of this raiding party, Gamel the Cruel. He has made his abode inside a cave on the beach.$b$bYou've dealt with his men already. Finish what you've started, $n. Avenge my father and I will share with you what little I still have.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Gamel the Cruel slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Mi propio padre fue asesinado por el líder de esa banda, Gamel el Cruel. Ha establecido su morada dentro de una cueva en la playa.$b$bYa te has encargado de sus hombres. Acaba lo que empezaste, $n. Venga a mi padre y compartiré lo poco que me queda contigo.', `Objectivetext1` = 'Gamel el Cruel matado', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esMX' AND `ID` = 11619;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Lees los grabados de la tablilla detenidamente por si hay algún texto que puedas entender. Al fin encuentras el siguiente fragmento:$B$B"Los hijos de la niebla reclamarán mil almas para aquel que habita en las aguas más oscuras. Entonces despertará su emisario."$B$BKaruk podría estar interesado en esta información.", Details AC enUS : "You scour through the tablet's etchings, looking for any text you can understand.  You finally find the following fragment:$B$B"The sons of the fog will claim a thousand souls for the one who dwells in darkest waters.  His emissary will then awake."$B$BKaruk might be interested in this information." ; Wowhead enUS : "You scour through the tablet's etchings, looking for any text you can understand. You finally find the following fragment:$b$b"The sons of the fog will claim a thousand souls for the one who dwells in darkest waters. His emissary will then awake."$b$bKaruk might be interested in this information."
