-- AC datas : OLD Details : "La madre reproductiva de los jormungar vive en las cavernas de debajo. La llamamos Cascabore, un nombre que le otorgó una aventurera de las Tierras de la Peste. Solo la vi durante un segundo, mientras intentaba rechazar su primer ataque: es lo suficientemente grande como para devorarme de un bocado. La caverna no será nuestra hasta que la echemos de ella.", Details AC enUS : "The jormungar have a spawnmother in the caverns below. We call her Rattlebore - a name that was gifted to her by an adventurer from the Plaguelands. I saw her only briefly as I was fighting off their initial onslaught - she is large enough to make even my icy bones shiver. This cavern will not be ours until she is removed from it.$b$bGather your friends and end this." ; Wowhead enUS : "The jormungar have a spawnmother in the caverns below. We call her Rattlebore - a name that was gifted to her by an adventurer from the Plaguelands. I saw her only briefly as I was fighting off their initial onslaught - she is large enough to make even my icy bones shiver. This cavern will not be ours until she is removed from it.$b$bGather your friends and end this.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Rattlebore slain"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'La madre reproductiva de los jormungar vive en las cavernas de debajo. La llamamos Cascabore, un nombre que le otorgó una aventurera de las Tierras de la Peste. Solo la vi durante un segundo, mientras intentaba rechazar su primer ataque: es lo suficientemente grande como para hacer temblar hasta a mis helados huesos. La caverna no será nuestra hasta que la echemos de ella.$b$bReúne a tus amigos y termina con esto.', `Objectivetext1` = 'Cascabore matado', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esMX' AND `ID` = 12080;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Escucha, $gchico:chica;. Este no es lugar para que andes jugando.$B$BYo voy a intentar largarme. Quédate conmigo y te sacaré de aquí.", Details AC enUS : "Listen, kid. This is no place for you to be playin' around.$b$bI'm about to make a break for it. Stick with me and I'll get you outta here." ; Wowhead enUS : "Listen, kid. This is no place for you to be playin' around.$b$bI'm about to make a break for it. Stick with me and I'll get you outta here."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Escucha, $gchico:chica. Este no es lugar para que andes jugando.$b$bYo voy a intentar largarme. Quédate conmigo y te sacaré de aquí.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esMX' AND `ID` = 12082;
