tincts, perfect timing, and improvisation at every step.$b$bLet me know when you're ready, $r. And remember, timing is everything!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Truth Serum Created" ; Wowhead enUS : "Truth Serum Created"
