-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$n, me han pedido que te diera esto en cuanto terminaras de encargarte de los espías Roca Negra. Parece una carta sellada con la insignia del hermano Sammuel, nuestro instructor de paladines. Si fuera tú, la leería antes de hacer cualquier otra cosa en la Abadía.", Details AC enUS : "I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, $N. It appears to be a letter sealed with the insignia of Brother Sammuel, our local paladin trainer. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey." ; Wowhead enUS : "I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, $n. It appears to be a letter sealed with the insignia of Brother Sammuel, our local paladin trainer. I wouldn't hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey."
