-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$n, me fue confiada esta runa para que te la entregara. Cuando tengas la oportunidad, léela. Creo que es de Thran, el instructor de guerreros. Échale un vistazo y, cuando puedas, ve a buscar a Thran a Yunquemar.", Details AC enUS : "While you were helping me out, this rune was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the warrior trainer Thran. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance." ; Wowhead enUS : "While you were helping me out, this rune was given to me to pass on to you. Take some time to read it when you have a chance. I'm thinkin' it came from the warrior trainer Thran. Take a gander at it and go find him inside Anvilmar when you've a chance."
