-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "Habla con Thotar en Cerrotajo, en Durotar.", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Thotar at Razor Hill in Durotar." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Thotar at Razor Hill.",  OLD Details : "Hola, joven $gcazador:cazadora;. Me estás mirando como si fueras capaz de domar a cualquier bestia y entrenarla para convertirla en tu compañera.$B$BDebes ir a ver a Thotar en Cerrotajo. Él puede guiarte para que consigas tu propia mascota.", Details AC enUS : "Hello, young hunter. You look to me like you are skilled enough to handle a beast and train it as your companion.$B$BYou must see Thotar at Razor Hill. He can put you on the path to earning a pet of your own." ; Wowhead enUS : "Hello, young hunter. You look to me like you are skilled enough to handle a beast and train it as your companion.$b$bYou must see Thotar at Razor Hill. He can put you on the path to earning a pet of your own."
