-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Debemos esta oportunidad en gran parte a tus esfuerzos, $n.$B$BLo más apropiado es que tú inicies el ataque contra Malygos.$B$BToma esta chispa y úsala para encender la señal de fuego al noroeste de El Nexo. Keristrasza te dirigirá desde allí.", Details AC enUS : "We owe this opportunity in great part to your efforts, $n.$b$bIt is only fitting that you initiate the attack on Malygos.$b$bTake this spark and use it to light the signal fire northwest of the Nexus. Keristrasza will direct you from there." ; Wowhead enUS : "We owe this opportunity in great part to your efforts, $n.$b$bIt is only fitting that you initiate the attack on Malygos.$b$bTake this spark and use it to light the signal fire northwest of the Nexus. Keristrasza will direct you from there."
