-- AC datas : OLD Details : "He oído que vas a ir a asegurarte de que Har'koa esté a salvo. Buena suerte.$B$BMe preguntaba si cuando estés cerca del altar, podrías recoger sus reliquias. No necesito muchas y solo es un pequeño viaje hacia el sureste.$B$B¿Qué me dices?", Details AC enUS : "I overheard that you are going to see to the well-being of Har'koa. Good luck to you.$B$BI am wondering if while you are in the vicinity of the altar, you would be willing to recover their relics? I do not require many, and it is only a short trip to the southeast.$B$BWhat do you say?" ; Wowhead enUS : "I overheard that you are going to see to the well-being of Har'koa. Good luck to you.$b$bI am wondering if while you are in the vicinity of the altar, you would be willing to recover their relics? I do not require many, and it is only a short trip to the southeast.$b$bWhat do you say?"
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'He oído que vas a ir a asegurarte de que Har''koa esté a salvo. Buena suerte.$b$bMe preguntaba si cuando estés cerca del altar, podrías recoger sus reliquias. No necesito muchas y solo es un pequeño viaje hacia el sureste.$b$b¿Qué me dices?', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'esMX' AND `ID` = 12635;
-- AC datas : OLD Details : "Ya fuese sabiduría o suerte, algo te salvó de llevar esta gargantilla, $r.$b$bDe cualquier manera, tu adquisición no fue de casualidad. Has sido $gelegido:elegida; por alguien o algo…$b$bLleva la gargantilla a Rosangre. Deja que te muestre lo que casi te depara el destino.", Details AC enUS : "It was either wisdom or luck that prevented you from wearing this choker, $r.$b$bEither way, your acquiring it was no random occurance. You've been targeted by someone, or something....$b$bTake your choker to Bloodrose, here. Let her demonstrate the fate that nearly befell you." ; Wowhead enUS : "It was either wisdom or luck that prevented you from wearing this choker, $r.$b$bEither way, your acquiring it was no random occurance. You've been targeted by someone, or something....$b$bTake your choker to Bloodrose, here. Let her demonstrate the fate that nearly befell you.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Choker's Purpose Exposed" ; Wowhead enUS : "Choker's Purpose Exposed"
