-- AC datas : OLD Details : "$gBienvenido:Bienvenida; a Conquista del Invierno, $n. Tu misión es sencilla. Derrota a 10 de los mejores de la Horda. ¡Ahora vete! ¡Trae la victoria a la Alianza!", Details AC enUS : "Welcome to the Wintergrasp, $n. Your mission is simple. Defeat ten of the Horde's finest. Now, go! Bring victory to the Alliance!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Welcome to Wintergrasp, $n. Your mission is simple. Defeat ten of the Horde's finest. Now, go! Bring victory to the Alliance!",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "Miembros de la Horda asesinados", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Horde members slain" ; Wowhead enUS : "Warsong Champion",  OLD Objectivetext3 : "", Objectivetext3 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Commander Dardosh"
