-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "Habla de nuevo con Mokra el Trituracráneos si quieres convertirte en $gValeroso:Valerosa; de Orgrimmar.", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Mokra the Skullcrusher again if you wish to become a valiant of Orgrimmar." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Mokra the Skullcrusher again if you wish to become a valiant of Orgrimmar.",  OLD Details : "¿Así que ahora eres $gun Campeón:una Campeona;? Entonces has demostrado ser $gun combatiente digno:una combatiente digna; y me llena de orgullo darte la bienvenida a nuestra delegación de Orgrimmar.$b$bTe entrenarás y subirás de rango como antes, pero cuando seas $gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona; de Orgrimmar, tu brutito podrá optar a llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.", Details AC enUS : "So, you have become a champion? Then, you have proven yourself a worthy combatant and I would proudly welcome you into Orgrimmar's delegation.$B$BYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Orgrimmar, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle." ; Wowhead enUS : "So, you have become a champion? Then, you have proven yourself a worthy combatant and I would proudly welcome you into Orgrimmar's delegation.$b$bYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Orgrimmar, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle."
