-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "Habla de nuevo con Zul'tore si deseas convertirte en $gun Valeroso:una Valerosa; de Sen'jin.", Objectives AC enUS : "Speak with Zul'tore again if you wish to become a valiant of Sen'jin." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Zul'tore again if you wish to become a valiant of Sen'jin.",  OLD Details : "Saludos, $gCampeón:Campeona;. Si lo deseas, te doy la bienvenida a nuestra delegación de Sen'jin en el torneo.$b$bTe entrenarás y subirás de rango como antes, pero cuando seas $gnombrado Campeón:nombrada Campeona; de Sen'jin, tu brutito podrá optar a llevar nuestro estandarte a la batalla.", Details AC enUS : "Greetings, champion. If you are willing, I would welcome you into Sen'jin's tournament delegation.$B$BYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Sen'jin, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle." ; Wowhead enUS : "Greetings, champion. If you are willing, I would welcome you into Sen'jin's tournament delegation.$b$bYou will train and rise through the ranks as you have before, but when you are named a champion of Sen'jin, your gruntling will have the option of carrying our banner into battle."
