-- AC datas : OLD Objectives : "Libera a 15 esclavos de la Alianza y mata al maestro de forja Gargelus.", Objectives AC enUS : "Free 15 Alliance Slaves and kill Forgemaster Garfrost." ; Wowhead enUS : "Free 6 quarry camps and kill Forgemaster Garfrost.",  OLD Details : "¡A nuestros soldados capturados los han puesto a trabajar en la cantera!$B$BMata a sus captores y libéralos, $ghéroe:heroína;. Necesitaremos su ayuda cuando nos enfrentemos al Señor de la Plaga Tyrannus.", Details AC enUS : "They've put our captured soldiers to work in the quarry! Kill their captors and set them free, hero, and do it quickly. We will need their aid when we confront Scourgelord Tyrannus." ; Wowhead enUS : "They've put my captured soldiers to work in the quarry!$b$bKill their captors and set them free, hero. We will need their aid when we confront Scourgelord Tyrannus.",  OLD Objectivetext1 : "", Objectivetext1 AC enUS : "Alliance Slaves freed" ; Wowhead enUS : "Quarry camps freed",  OLD Objectivetext2 : "", Objectivetext2 AC enUS : "" ; Wowhead enUS : "Forgemaster Garfrost slain"
